  "labelNotes": "No ROC table; supply range from the DC Characteristics VDD row (same as the table header 'VDD = 2.7V to 5.5V'). VRET register-retention voltage (2.4 V) excluded as not an operating supply. IDD conditions print both FOSC = 25 MHz and FCLK = 1 MHz; only the oscillator frequency is kept as F (judgement call). IDDS temperature ranges are printed in the row without a symbol; written as TA (table uses TAMB). The 8 uA IDDS line is cited by its condition cell, which also occurs on the 5 uA line; 'OSC1 Pin' also occurs on the VIH/VIL lines. ILI for 'All I/Os except OSC1 and TXnRTS' and for the OSC1 (oscillator input) pin both labelled as input leakage; the ILI row's 'VIN = VSS to VDD' is pin voltage, not supply, so dropped. Abs max: VDD 7.0 V; 'All Inputs and Outputs ... VDD + 1.0V' skipped as an expression."
